<title>USA: Dana to sell hydraulic cylinder operations.</title>
<headline>Dana to sell hydraulic cylinder operations.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dana Corp said on Thursday that it would sell its global hydraulic cylinder manufacturing operations to Empire Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Included in the sale are operations in Arab, Ala., and Lancaster, Texas; the Lessard operation in St. Wenceslas, Quebec and the Erwin Hengstler Hydraulik GmbH facility in Hausach, Germany.</p>
<p>The operations had sales of $75 million in 1996 out of Dana's 1996 sales of $7.7 billion.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
